{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras_big/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256 width=800 height=45 /></span>Hide and Seek is a 3D psychological horror game that lets you explore interconnected mysteries inside a haunted family home filled with dark secrets. You\u2019ll investigate, hide, and fight\u2014with swordplay, magic, and your fists\u2014while uncovering clues and facing intrusions from other realities that bleed into the house.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Emil, raised by his grandmother, you move through the herb shop, the greenhouse, the backyard labyrinth, and upstairs rooms heavy with family history. Each episode opens a new layer of the past and brief oneiric crossings through the Veil. Solve tactile, emotional puzzles and piece together fragmented memories to reveal what the house refuses to say out loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evernoth and Seek unfolds episodically inside a single, lived-in home. Explore familiar corridors, slip into dreamlike spaces, and face duel-like encounters using blade work, spells, and hand-to-hand combat. Each chapter ties a room, a bond, and a wound\u2014connecting clues across the house as the larger Evernoth mystery threads through its walls.Hide and Seek is a 3D psychological horror game that lets you explore interconnected mysteries inside a haunted family home filled with dark secrets. You\u2019ll investigate, hide, and fight\u2014with swordplay, ritual magic, and bare-knuckle combat\u2014while uncovering clues and facing intrusions from other realities that bleed into the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Emil, a teenager raised by his grandmother, you embark on an episodic journey through the herb shop, the greenhouse, the backyard labyrinth, and the upstairs rooms heavy with family history. Each episode opens a new layer of the past and oneiric crossings through the Veil. You\u2019ll solve emotional, tactile puzzles and piece together fragmented memories to reveal what the house refuses to say out loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to confront not only what stalks you\u2014the cursed doll and beasts from elsewhere\u2014but also the psychological depths of trauma and fear. Will you uncover the truths binding these stories, or be consumed by the mysteries you seek to unravel?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras_big/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256 width=800 height=45 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3265770?t=1771407256","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771407256","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/1325b59921ce813e72b0daf0f7072b72af0ad182/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771407256","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/1325b59921ce813e72b0daf0f7072b72af0ad182/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771407256","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The content of the game is not fully decided yet, but it will feature sensitive themes such as suicide, murder, and child abuse, represented through dark symbolism. The game explores topics like depression, suicide, child abuse, and non-realistic dark symbolic themes such as witchcraft and commentary on religion."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4179350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras_big/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256 width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras/d8672b13d95f05d0aa900876ace2197a.avif?t=1771407256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras_big/d8672b13d95f05d0aa900876ace2197a.avif?t=1771407256 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras_big/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256 width=800 height=45 /></span></p></p><br><h1>ABOUT THIS GAME</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras_big/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256 width=800 height=45 /></span>What Secrets Lurk Within the Puppeteer\u2019s Strings?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Mystery. Confront the Terror. Survive the Nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a gripping narrative horror experience where the line between truth and legend frays. In <strong>The Puppeteer</strong>, you\u2019ll guide <strong>Emil</strong> as he follows a trail of scorched reports, broken toys, and conflicting testimonies around a figure blamed for disappearances\u2014and whispered about as a savior of the lost. Every shadow hides a thread; every room, a contradiction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Horror Meets Epic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face more than rumors. As Emil digs deeper, <strong>things wearing the shape of dolls</strong> and <strong>beasts drawn by strings of fear</strong> step out from behind the curtain. These entities\u2014echoes born from guilt, grief, and obsession\u2014test your nerve in <strong>intense, duel-like encounters</strong>. With fragments of memory, quick thinking, and <strong>swordplay, magic, and bare-knuckle combat</strong>, Emil must stand his ground when the past pulls taut.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A House of Forgotten Stories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the eerie corridors of <strong>his grandmother\u2019s home</strong>\u2014unsent letters, doors sealed by superstition, a shop ledger marked with strange sigils. Each chapter unravels a tale tied to people who crossed paths with the <strong>Puppeteer</strong>. From a dusty attic of marionettes to a kitchen where someone left the <strong>light on</strong> as a ward, spaces feel lived-in, haunted, and heavy with choice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Liminal Worlds, Fractured Spaces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality thins as Emil brushes the <strong>Veil</strong>: schoolyards at dusk, back-alley stages, and <strong>oneiric rooms</strong> stitched with red thread. These places become battlegrounds for your most perilous encounters\u2014where what you fight is as much <strong>story</strong> as <strong>monster</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative Exploration and Emotional Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover meaningful objects\u2014<strong>a cracked porcelain doll, a bundle of letters tied in red, a scorched police clipping</strong>\u2014each revealing another facet of the <strong>Puppeteer\u2019s</strong> myth. Puzzles blend inference and emotion: arrange timelines, read between marginal notes, and assemble a <strong>collage of memories</strong> to decide what (and who) to believe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Series of Mysteries Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Puppeteer</strong> is only the beginning. The <strong>Deep Descent</strong> series will lead you further through the lives tethered to <strong>Emil\u2019s house</strong>\u2014each episode a new, interconnected mystery: a tapestry of fear, hope, and the price of looking behind the curtain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying Narrative:</strong> A deeply emotional story about rumor, grief, and the cost of truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Battles:</strong> Face grotesque entities in <strong>cinematic, duel-like encounters</strong> using <strong>swordplay, magic, and hand-to-hand combat</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liminal Exploration:</strong> Traverse familiar halls and <strong>oneiric spaces</strong> where nothing is as it first appears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Puzzles:</strong> Challenges that ask for logic <strong>and</strong> empathy; read objects as if they were people.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episodic Mystery:</strong> Each chapter reveals a new thread tied to the <strong>Puppeteer\u2019s</strong> legacy within Emil\u2019s home.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you cut the strings\u2014or discover they\u2019re the only thing holding the truth together?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras_big/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256 width=800 height=45 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras_big/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256 width=800 height=45 /></span>Hide and Seek is a 3D psychological horror game that lets you explore interconnected mysteries inside a haunted family home filled with dark secrets. You\u2019ll investigate, hide, and fight\u2014with swordplay, magic, and your fists\u2014while uncovering clues and facing intrusions from other realities that bleed into the house.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Emil, raised by his grandmother, you move through the herb shop, the greenhouse, the backyard labyrinth, and upstairs rooms heavy with family history. Each episode opens a new layer of the past and brief oneiric crossings through the Veil. Solve tactile, emotional puzzles and piece together fragmented memories to reveal what the house refuses to say out loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evernoth and Seek unfolds episodically inside a single, lived-in home. Explore familiar corridors, slip into dreamlike spaces, and face duel-like encounters using blade work, spells, and hand-to-hand combat. Each chapter ties a room, a bond, and a wound\u2014connecting clues across the house as the larger Evernoth mystery threads through its walls.Hide and Seek is a 3D psychological horror game that lets you explore interconnected mysteries inside a haunted family home filled with dark secrets. You\u2019ll investigate, hide, and fight\u2014with swordplay, ritual magic, and bare-knuckle combat\u2014while uncovering clues and facing intrusions from other realities that bleed into the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Emil, a teenager raised by his grandmother, you embark on an episodic journey through the herb shop, the greenhouse, the backyard labyrinth, and the upstairs rooms heavy with family history. Each episode opens a new layer of the past and oneiric crossings through the Veil. You\u2019ll solve emotional, tactile puzzles and piece together fragmented memories to reveal what the house refuses to say out loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to confront not only what stalks you\u2014the cursed doll and beasts from elsewhere\u2014but also the psychological depths of trauma and fear. Will you uncover the truths binding these stories, or be consumed by the mysteries you seek to unravel?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras_big/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256 width=800 height=45 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Sigmadev","Arasanta interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/d5927fc7e6b27bb8cdf1740072e420179e7961b4/header.jpg?t=1771407256","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265770/134270297/8f1306723f21e832f7028fc420f4778461df885f/1770988344/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771407255","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265770/134270297/8f1306723f21e832f7028fc420f4778461df885f/1770988344/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771407255","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265770/134270297/8f1306723f21e832f7028fc420f4778461df885f/1770988344/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771407255","id":257286601,"name":"evernoth battle trailer demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257286601/b0c5279a163badf55fdc5e8e7cd6b0af6311459f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771407255"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265770/1956584466/9e180b156a0dcda4984bb354bdf90995236a19de/1750885969/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760488940","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265770/1956584466/9e180b156a0dcda4984bb354bdf90995236a19de/1750885969/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760488940","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265770/1956584466/9e180b156a0dcda4984bb354bdf90995236a19de/1750885969/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760488940","id":257095679,"name":"Evernoth a Deep Descent vertical trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257095679/4449cd2ff05e1e3aeadaca0a4d42b0d668027144/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760488940"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265770/794296/2963a2b92f769fa788cffbb77696af